{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"pwd && sed -n '1,220p' __issue_context__.json && git status --short --branch\"","aggregated_output":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl\n{\n  \"body\": \"related #2097\\n\\n**tendon cell**\\n\\n- reclassify to 'fibroblast' and 'part of' some 'tendon' \\n- adjust the textual def accordingly\\n\\n**otic fibrocyte**\\n- reclassify from fibrocyte to mesenchymal cell (PMID: [37720106](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37720106/))\\n- add synonyms - cochlear fibrocyte (PMID: [31866825](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31866825/)) and spiral ligament fibrocyte (PMID: [33193034](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33193034/)\\n\\n**In a seperate ticket - refine otic fibrobalst and subclasses**\\n1) Currently, otic fibroblast is linked to spiral ligmanet but it encompasses both spiral ligament and spiral limbus - This definition should be relabelled to Cochlear fibrocytes (more widely used) and treated as the general term \\n2) A spiral ligament fibrocyte term should be added and all Type I-V subclasses should be added under it \\n3) More info should be added to the textual defs of the subclasses (especially functions) \\n\\nUseful refs \\n\\n- PMID: 24727668\\n- PMID: [31866825](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31866825/)\\n- PMID: [37720106](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37720106/) - newer paper\\n- PMID: [33193034](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33193034/) - newer paper -specific to Spiral ligament fibrocytes\\n\",\n  \"comments\": [],\n  \"title\": \"remove tendon cell and otic fibrocyte from under fibrocyte\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3239\"\n}\n## scribe-v1-ai4curation-cl-agent-config-v3-.-gpt-5.5-iter1-issue-3239\n D .github/copilot-instructions.md\n M CLAUDE.md\n?? AGENTS.md\n?? __agent_config__/\n?? __agent_prompt__.md\n?? __issue_context__.json\n?? __pr_result__/\n?? obo-scripts/\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
