.\")\n25724:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_1000308 \"fibrocyte of adventitia of ureter\")\n27368:# Class: obo:CL_1000691 (kidney interstitial myofibroblast)\n27371:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_1000691 \"kidney interstitial myofibroblast\")\n27375:# Class: obo:CL_1000692 (kidney interstitial fibroblast)\n27377:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:10559635\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_1000692 \"A fibroblast that is part of an interstitial compartment of a kidney.\")\n27379:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_1000692 \"kidney interstitial fibroblast\")\n27382:# Class: obo:CL_1000693 (kidney interstitial fibrocyte)\n27385:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_1000693 \"kidney interstitial fibrocyte\")\n28568:# Class: obo:CL_1001608 (foreskin fibroblast)\n28570:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"NPX:PDR\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_1001608 \"Fibroblast from foreskin.\")\n28572:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_1001608 \"BJ fibroblast\")\n28573:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_1001608 \"foreskin fibroblast\")\n28576:# Class: obo:CL_1001609 (muscle fibroblast)\n28578:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"NPX:PDR\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_1001609 \"Fibroblast from muscle organ.\")\n28580:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_1001609 \"muscle fibroblast\")\n28718:# Class: obo:CL_2000012 (fibroblast of pedal digit skin)\n28720:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:TermGenie\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_2000012 \"Any skin fibroblast that is part of a pedal digit skin.\")\n28724:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_2000012 \"fibroblast of pedal digit skin\")\n28727:# Class: obo:CL_2000013 (fibroblast of skin of abdomen)\n28729:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:TermGenie\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_2000013 \"Any skin fibroblast that is part of a skin of abdomen.\")\n28733:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_2000013 \"fibroblast of skin of abdomen\")\n28736: